# Example project (hono-marketplace)

- When changing WaveDB public API, auth, env vars, embed paths (`waveHost`, Studio, `connect`), or deployment docs, update **`examples/hono-marketplace`** in the same PR so it stays a copy-paste-ready reference.
- Verify with `bun test` and `bun run test:studio` in the example directory when touching embed or auth.
- Match documented env vars: `WAVE_DB_PATH`, `WAVE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `WAVE_SERVE_TOKEN`, `WAVE_SETUP_TOKEN`, `WAVE_TRUST_PROXY`.
- **Do not** mention example-only updates in **CHANGELOG.md**.
